Package: dsImagingClient
Title: DataSHIELD Client for Medical Imaging Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("David", "Sarrat González", , "david.sarrat@isglobal.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Xavier", "Escribà-Montagut", , "xavier.escriba@isglobal.org", role = c("aut")),
      person("Juan R", "González", , "juanr.gonzalez@isglobal.org", role = c("aut")))
Description: Client-side functions for distributed medical imaging analysis
    using DataSHIELD infrastructure. Provides functions to extract radiomic
    features from medical images stored in vault resources, processed via HPC.
    Works in conjunction with the server-side dsImaging package.
